==Description==
'''Legion''' is a [[Modifiers|modifier]] that only appears in the [[Legion (Challenge)|Legion]] challenge. It is similar to the [[All Paths]] modifier in that it spawns enemies from all paths, but this modifier includes major bosses. It also gives some enemies special attributes. The wave bonus is also decreased. To compensate, starting cash is increased.

==Effects==
When active, '''Legion''' will make most enemies spawn in equal amounts on each path. Unlike the [[All Paths]] modifier however, this includes major bosses such as the [[Fallen King]].

==Update History==
*'''21 June 2024''' - [[v1.25.0]]
**'''Legion''' added.
*'''24 September 2025''' - [[v1.75.0]]
**'''Legion''' can now be exclusively activated in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode through [[Legion (Challenge)|Legion]] challenge.



